  "body": "The Overview's cardio column now shows a glyph in a colored box instead of a text label.\n\n- Walk = treadmill session with one steady interval (`isSteadySession`); run = interval treadmill session; bike = bike.\n- Walk and run keep the shared treadmill color; the figure distinguishes them.\n- Glyphs are Material Icons paths (Apache 2.0), stored in `cardioConfig.js` — lucide has no walking/running figure.\n- Cardio column narrows from 146px to 32px. Multiple sessions on one day sit side by side so each icon stays legible.\n- Legend lists Walk / Run / Bike with glyphs. Hover panel unchanged; an SVG `\u003ctitle\u003e` carries the label.\n\nVerified with headless Chrome screenshots at desktop and 390px mobile. Lint, `npm test`, and `vite build` pass.",
  "changed_files": 2,
